        "raw": "<p>Unity&#39;s action &quot;Go Bots&quot; says its unlimited. so does that mean she can use &quot;Go Bots!&quot; three times using all of her actions. plus, can she choose the same bot over and over? finally, can the bot she choose do the same action over and over?</p><p>for instance, can mmr. chomps attack three times in a row from unity commanding him with Go bots?</p>",
